# Cloudflare Pages redirects. One rule per line: from, to, status.
#
# Built by diffing every URL in the live Wix sitemaps (41 pages, 38 posts)
# against the 79 files in this repo. Every live URL is either rebuilt at the
# same path or listed below. Nothing on the live site 404s at cutover.
#
# Rules are matched top to bottom, so the more specific path goes first.

# ── Wix URLs that no longer exist ─────────────────────────────────────────
# The line array URL under rent-sound-equipment serves the general sound
# equipment page's content at a slug promising line arrays. Whatever it ranks
# for is a line array query, so it goes to the dedicated page rather than to
# the page it was duplicating.
/rent-sound-equipment/line-array-speaker-rental-dallas-fort-worth  /rent-line-array-speaker-system  301

# Already a 301 on Wix. Preserved so the chain does not break at cutover.
/wedding-dj-packages              /services-dj             301

/rent-pa-speakers-lighting-video  /rent-sound-equipment    301
/corporate-event-av-rental        /corporate-events        301

# DEA does not do photo booths. This URL predates that decision.
/rent-photobooth                  /services-extra          301

# Wix's built-in site search. There is no equivalent on a static site.
/search                           /                        301

# ── SAFETY NET. Delete both lines once these two pages are rebuilt. ───────
# Both are real pages with real copy on the live site, so redirecting them is
# a loss, not a fix: they should be rebuilt at their own URLs before go-live.
# These lines exist only so that if the DNS switch happens first, a visitor
# lands on the nearest relevant page instead of the 404. Rebuilding the page
# and leaving the rule in place would make the new page unreachable, so the
# rule has to come out in the same commit that adds the page.
/photography-videography          /services-photo-and-video  302
/rent-lighting-equipment          /services-lighting         302
